guide completionist-horde/attune-scepter-of-celebras
title Scepter of Celebras (Maraudon key)
faction Horde
levels 49-49
category Dungeons
folder Completionist attunements and keys
zone Desolace
pitch Scepter of Celebras: Opens a portal from the first khan's spot in Maraudon's outer caves to Earth Song Falls in inner Maraudon; the group walks through it. Celebras the Redeemed makes it once Celebras the Cursed is dead inside.
why Opens a portal from the first khan's spot in Maraudon's outer caves to Earth Song Falls in inner Maraudon; the group walks through it. Celebras the Redeemed makes it once Celebras the Cursed is dead inside.



